      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so basically it's because pandas isn't sure if the slice is a view or a copy of the original data and it doesn't want me to accidentally mess up the original df? i just want to know if using .loc is better or if i should just keep using .copy() everywhere to be safe. which one is the standard way to handle this in a production pipeline?",
